WEBVTT

NOTE The recording has no sound; these captions say what happens on screen.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.701
Airc, on a made-up coffee shop. The ✦ button next to Back and Forward opens the Airc Agent.

00:02.701 --> 00:07.364
Connect your AI: “Use your ChatGPT subscription” (Codex) is picked with Use.

00:07.364 --> 00:11.368
The task: “Compare the Pour and Rapid kettles and buy the better one for pour over coffee. Ask me before you pay.”

00:11.368 --> 00:26.368
The agent's page plays live in the pane: it searches the shop, puts both kettles side by side, says why the Pour suits pour-over, and adds it to the bag.

00:26.368 --> 00:31.161
At Pay, Airc stops it and asks: “Pay on steepwell.aircbrowser.com?” Deny, or Allow once.

00:31.161 --> 00:38.161
The run is opened from the sidebar's Agents folder, and Allow once is clicked.

00:38.161 --> 00:43.661
The order is placed, and the agent says which kettle it bought and why.
